// The ledger for the only paid call in door knocking. Spend used to be read
// off the frozen routes themselves (door_knocking_stop rows joined to
// door_knocking_route), on the premise that a route is created exactly when
// the vendor is called — but the Route Planner call happens INSIDE the knock
// transaction, so anything that rolls back afterwards discards the record of
// money already spent and hands the same allowance out twice.
//
// Rows here are written on their own connection, outside that transaction, the
// moment the vendor returns. They are append-only and never cascade: a turf can
// be deleted, a route can fail to freeze, and the spend still happened.
//
// The per-org allowance that first justified surviving a rollback has since
// been removed, and no code reads these rows now. They stay as the record that
// outlives log retention: the budget alerts sum the `DoorKnockingSpend` log
// line, and this is what the per-org SQL in docs/door-knocking.md
// § Spend visibility is run against once a tier fires.
model DoorKnockingRoutePlannerSpend {
  id                 Int      @id @default(autoincrement())
  occurredAt         DateTime @default(now()) @map("occurred_at")
  organizationSlug   String   @map("organization_slug")
  // Deliberately a plain Int and not a relation: a foreign key would let a
  // turf deletion cascade away the spend it caused, which is the opposite of
  // what a ledger is for. Informational only — nothing joins on it.
  doorKnockingTurfId Int?     @map("door_knocking_turf_id")
  // Waypoints (stops) sent to the vendor. A measurement with nothing behind
  // it: no per-org limit is denominated in stops any more.
  waypoints          Int
  // Geoapify credits for both calls the route was billed for: the Route
  // Planner optimization and the Routing request behind its path geometry.
  // Not derivable from `waypoints` — the Route Planner's per-location rate is
  // quadratic below ten locations, the agent's anchors are locations of their
  // own, and a geometry fetch that never completed is not charged.
  credits            Int

  // Served the rolling-window sum in `assertWaypointQuota`, which is gone.
  // Kept for the shape every hand-run query in § Spend visibility has — one
  // organization over one window.
  @@index([organizationSlug, occurredAt])
  @@map("door_knocking_route_planner_spend")
}
